{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415663","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415663","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1041566301:1":{"text":"最近肩膀和脖颈的肌肉总是紧绷绷的。","source_cn":"最近肩膀和脖颈的肌肉总是紧绷绷的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x908A0D2FF60275E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041566302:1":{"text":"虽然让亲卫帮忙按过，也请过医师，但效果有限啊。","source_cn":"虽然让亲卫帮忙按过，也请过医师，但效果有限啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2477495067F5A441","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041566303:1":{"text":"毕竟岁数到了，又要经常挥舞武器，常运动的地方就常有损耗。","source_cn":"毕竟岁数到了，又要经常挥舞武器，常运动的地方就常有损耗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29BE598BC9BF39E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041566304:1":{"text":"噢，看起来你也是一位身经百战的战士。","source_cn":"噢，看起来你也是一位身经百战的战士。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCDB1A3B750F604B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041566305:1":{"text":"你这手臂上的伤真了不得，多少年了？看着恢复得也不错。","source_cn":"你这手臂上的伤真了不得，多少年了？看着恢复得也不错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9235D5D8E27C8A2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_titl